cal order of their names (as guaranteed by ConcurrentSkipListMap).', 'description': 'Create a Zone with origin "example.com." and add RRsets for "a.example.com.", "z.example.com.", and "m.example.com.". Verify that toMasterFile() outputs the origin node first and the other three nodes in the order a, m, z.'}]}, {'group': 'Null origin leads to NPE', 'cases': [{'input': [], 'expected': 'NullPointerException is thrown because origin is null and the method calls origin.equals(entry.getKey()).', 'description': 'Create a Zone but never set its origin (origin remains null). Add any RRset (e.g., for "test.example.com."). Calling toMasterFile() should result in a NullPointerException.'}]}]
